{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat/issues/5089","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat/issues/5089/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat/issues/5089/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat/issues/5089/events","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat/issues/5089","id":4333777829,"node_id":"I_kwDOO5YBL88AAAABAlAzpQ","number":5089,"title":"vscode_askQuestions rejects exactly 1 option with allowFreeformInput: true","user":{"login":"yilims","id":109205537,"node_id":"U_kgDOBoJYIQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109205537?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yilims","html_url":"https://github.com/yilims","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yilims/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yilims/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yilims/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yilims/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yilims/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yilims/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yilims/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yilims/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yilims/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-27T07:08:34Z","updated_at":"2026-04-27T07:31:59Z","closed_at":"2026-04-27T07:31:59Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bug Report\n\n### Description\n\nWhen calling `vscode_askQuestions` with exactly **1 option** and `\"allowFreeformInput\": true`, the tool returns an error.\n\n### Error Message\n\n```\nERROR while calling tool: Question \"migration-scope\" must have at least two options, or none for free text input.\n```\n\n### Steps to Reproduce\n\nCall `vscode_askQuestions` with the following input:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"questions\": [\n    {\n      \"header\": \"migration-scope\",\n      \"question\": \"What do you want to migrate to Azure?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"My entire application\",\n          \"description\": \"Assess the full codebase, identify all changes needed, and build a complete migration plan\",\n          \"recommended\": true\n        }\n      ],\n      \"allowFreeformInput\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\n1 predefined option + `allowFreeformInput: true` should be valid, rendering as:\n- Option 1: predefined label\n- Option 2: free text input field\n\nThis combination (1 option + freeform) results in 2 total items for the user, which is a reasonable and useful pattern for agent prompts.\n\n### Actual Behavior\n\nThe tool call fails with a validation error requiring >= 2 options or 0 options.\n\n### Workaround\n\nUse >= 2 explicit options with `allowFreeformInput: false`.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"yilims","id":109205537,"node_id":"U_kgDOBoJYIQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109205537?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yilims","html_url":"https://github.com/yilims","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yilims/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yilims/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yilims/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yilims/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yilims/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yilims/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yilims/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yilims/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yilims/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat/issues/5089/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat/issues/5089/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null},"comments":[]}